      "message": "I left my comments about this change in the bug.\n\nI have a few concerns with this:\n - it can lead to including the same SMS session into multiple proto buffers, if the dumpsys command is invoked multiple times. This might not be desirable.\n - it could be confusing to have some incomplete SMS sessions in the dumpsys (e.g. was this a bug or just a timing issue?)\n - the behavior for SMS would become inconsistent with the behavior of voice calls (currently the proto buffer only includes completed calls).\n\nPlease, provide more details in the bug. If there is a need to include in-progress sessions, I think we can find a different solution (e.g. a new repeated SmsSession in_progress_sms_sessions field inside TelephonyLog message).",
